---
// src/components/CarriersStrip.astro - Franja corta para transportistas
---

<section class="carriers-strip" aria-labelledby="carriers-title">
  <div class="container carriers-container" data-reveal="card">
    <div class="carriers-box">
      <div class="carriers-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"></rect>
          <polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"></polygon>
          <circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle>
          <circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="carriers-copy">
        <h2 id="carriers-title" class="carriers-title">¿Eres transportista?</h2>
        <p class="carriers-text">
          Recibes el DeCA por correo, con su enlace. Tu conductor lo abre en el móvil o lee el QR: sin registrarse ni instalar nada. Si trabajas con almacenes que todavía lo hacen uno a uno, cuéntales que existe DECA Light.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .carriers-strip {
    padding-block: 3rem;
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
  }

  .carriers-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface, var(--palette-white));
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .carriers-box {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    }
  }

  .carriers-icon {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 6px);
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .carriers-copy {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .carriers-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
  }

  .carriers-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
